{"nodes": [{"id": "web_app_index_bootstrap", "label": "bootstrap (routeur d'entr\u00e9e /app)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L1528", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Trois modes d'entr\u00e9e exclusifs : lien locataire ?t= (contrat par token), lien public ?demande= (formulaire de r\u00e9servation), sinon session admin Supabase ou \u00e9cran neutre avec bouton Admin."}, {"id": "web_app_index_dologin", "label": "doLogin (login admin /app)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L1550", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Authentification Supabase signInWithPassword avec un email admin fixe (ADMIN_EMAIL) : le mot de passe saisi est le seul secret, l'email n'est jamais demand\u00e9."}, {"id": "web_app_index_showpage", "label": "showPage (navigation onglets admin)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L1565", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_app_index_loadsettings", "label": "loadSettings (owner_settings)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L1178", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_app_index_insertcontract", "label": "insertContract", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L1204", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "L'access_token g\u00e9n\u00e9r\u00e9 c\u00f4t\u00e9 DB est le secret d'acc\u00e8s locataire ; le code \u00e0 4 chiffres n'est plus qu'un libell\u00e9 humain affichable."}, {"id": "web_app_index_fetchcontractbytoken", "label": "fetchContractByToken", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L1273", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lecture locataire par token via RPC avec projection minimis\u00e9e c\u00f4t\u00e9 DB, au lieu d'un select direct sur la table."}, {"id": "web_app_index_loadcontractslist", "label": "loadContractsList", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L1311", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_app_index_initadmincal", "label": "initAdminCal (calendrier admin int\u00e9gr\u00e9)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L2280", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fusionne trois sources en un seul jeu d'\u00e9v\u00e9nements normalis\u00e9s : contrats (dates FR jj/mm/aaaa dans payload), r\u00e9servations (dates ISO) et blocs d'indisponibilit\u00e9."}, {"id": "web_app_index_renderadmincal", "label": "renderAdminCal", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L2322", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_app_index_loaddisponibilites", "label": "loadDisponibilites", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L2380", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le formulaire public lit reservations_public (vue sans donn\u00e9es personnelles) et non la table reservations : le visiteur anonyme ne doit voir que les plages occup\u00e9es."}, {"id": "web_app_index_renderavailcal", "label": "renderAvailCal (calendrier public de dispo)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L2430", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_app_index_initdemande", "label": "initDemande (formulaire public ?demande=)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L2468", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_app_index_submitdemande", "label": "submitDemande (envoi demande de r\u00e9servation)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L2485", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le bouton est d\u00e9sactiv\u00e9 AVANT l'attente r\u00e9seau : un double clic lancerait deux r\u00e9servations et compterait deux conversions ; r\u00e9activ\u00e9 seulement sur erreur. L'\u00e9v\u00e9nement GA4 est pouss\u00e9 APR\u00c8S l'affichage de la confirmation et dans son propre try : GTM remplace dataLayer.push par une ex\u00e9cution synchrone des balises, et une balise fautive ne doit pas faire croire \u00e0 un \u00e9chec alors que la r\u00e9servation est en base (le client renverrait un doublon). Aucune donn\u00e9e personnelle dans l'\u00e9v\u00e9nement (GA4 l'interdit). Les cr\u00e9neaux AM/PM sont encod\u00e9s dans les notes via un tag <SLOTS>."}, {"id": "web_app_index_copierliendem", "label": "copierLienDem (copie lien ?demande=)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L2550", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_app_index_loaddemandeslist", "label": "loadDemandesList (liste admin des demandes)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L2565", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_app_index_renderdemandeslist", "label": "renderDemandesList", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L2584", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_app_index_renderdemandecard", "label": "renderDemandeCard", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L2597", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "D\u00e9code le tag <SLOTS> stock\u00e9 dans notes pour r\u00e9afficher les cr\u00e9neaux AM/PM ; \u00e9chappe tout le HTML (escHtml) car notes vient d'un formulaire public."}, {"id": "web_app_index_setdemstatus", "label": "setDemStatus", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L2636", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_app_index_supprimerdemande", "label": "supprimerDemande", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L2644", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_app_index_prefillcontratfromdemande", "label": "prefillContratFromDemande", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L2654", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pont demande\u2192contrat : transporte les donn\u00e9es de la r\u00e9servation via JSON encod\u00e9 en URI dans l'attribut onclick, pr\u00e9remplit le formulaire de contrat et saute \u00e0 l'\u00e9tape conducteurs."}, {"id": "web_app_index_envlocsig", "label": "envLocSig (signature locataire)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L2713", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_app_index_envlrsig", "label": "envLrSig (signature retour locataire)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L2699", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "web_app_index_inviteclientbyemail", "label": "inviteClientByEmail", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "web/app/index.html", "source_location": "L1519", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "supabase_table_reservations", "label": "Table Supabase reservations", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "web/app/i